<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Source of truth for every user-facing string in the Android receiver.

    Translations live in values-<code>/strings.xml and must use these exact keys.
    Adding a string here without translating it is fine — Android falls back to
    this file per key, so a partial translation degrades to English rather than
    crashing. See localization/README.md for the contribution flow (the macOS app
    uses .lproj/Localizable.strings for the same set of languages).
-->
